    <statement><p>Find the first partial derivatives of the function <m>\displaystyle z = (5 x + 8 y)^{12}.</m></p>
<p><alert> 1.</alert> <m>\displaystyle \frac{\partial z}{\partial x} =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert> 2.</alert> <m>\displaystyle \frac{\partial z}{\partial y} =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>12\mathopen{}\left(5x+8y\right)^{11}\cdot 5</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>12\mathopen{}\left(5x+8y\right)^{11}\cdot 8</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
